        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "가볍게 매일, 짧은 통화 한 번"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick run through this talk's key phrases — anything left joins your review queue in Practice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein kurzer Durchgang durch die wichtigsten Sätze dieses Gesprächs — der Rest landet in deiner Wiederholungsliste unter Practice."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 대화의 핵심 문장만 빠르게 복습해요 — 나머지는 Practice의 복습 큐로 들어가요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder that your trial is about to convert — we ask to send notifications when the trial starts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "체험이 곧 결제로 바뀐다는 알림이에요. 체험이 시작될 때 알림 권한을 여쭤봐요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A scene costs one count however long it runs, and the count resets every day." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Szene zählt einmal, egal wie lang sie läuft, und die Zählung beginnt jeden Tag neu."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "상황연습은 길이와 상관없이 한 번으로 계산되고, 매일 다시 채워져요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A seat has to be free. If all %lld are taken, you wait." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es muss ein Platz frei sein. Sind alle %lld belegt, wartest du."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "빈자리가 있어야 들어가요. %lld자리가 다 차 있으면 기다려요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sentence lands here once it reaches the top of the review ladder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Satz landet hier, sobald er die oberste Stufe der Wiederholungsleiter erreicht."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "문장은 복습 사다리 꼭대기에 도달하면 여기로 와요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A separate pool" : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of a feature that lets users know a different pool is used for watch scenes compared to talking.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "따로 있는 몫"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A separate pool. Watching a scene never takes a minute off your talk time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "따로 있는 몫이에요. 상황연습을 봐도 통화 시간은 1분도 안 줄어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short call now and then" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "가끔 짧게 통화"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stock voice that plays \"you\" — your cloned voice is never used, and nobody's talks with your persona are ever shown to you or anyone else." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Standardstimme spielt „dich“ — deine geklonte Stimme wird nie verwendet, und niemandes Gespräche mit deinem Persona werden dir oder anderen je gezeigt."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"나\"를 연기하는 기본 목소리예요 — 내 클론 목소리는 절대 쓰이지 않고, 누가 내 페르소나와 나눈 대화도 나를 포함해 누구에게도 보이지 않아요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A voice for the other person. Add people under Watch to have someone specific play the scene." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Stimme für dein Gegenüber. Füge unter Watch Personen hinzu, damit jemand Bestimmtes die Szene spielt."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "상대방 목소리예요. 상황연습에서 사람을 추가하면 그 사람이 상대를 연기해요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A voice model is personal in a way a password isn't. Here's exactly what happens to it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
