    "Credits power new voice synthesis and AI calls, and refill every cycle. Replays, drills, and progress stay free forever." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Credits treiben neue Sprachsynthese und KI-Anrufe an und füllen sich jeden Zyklus wieder auf. Wiederholen, Üben und Fortschritt bleiben für immer kostenlos."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "크레딧은 새 음성을 합성하고 AI와 통화할 때 쓰이고, 주기마다 다시 채워져요. 다시 듣기·드릴·진행 상황은 언제까지나 무료고요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Credits power voice synthesis and AI replies. Invite friends to earn more." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
