    "Everything you read in the app — menus, buttons, corrections, notes — is in this language." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alles, was du in der App liest – Menüs, Schaltflächen, Korrekturen, Notizen – ist in dieser Sprache."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "메뉴, 버튼, 교정, 노트까지 앱에서 읽는 모든 것이 이 언어로 나와요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything you set aside is still waiting for its turn. Today's goals are on the Practice tab." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alles Zurückgestellte wartet noch auf seinen Termin. Die heutigen Ziele stehen im Übungs-Tab."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "미뤄둔 항목들은 아직 차례를 기다리는 중이에요. 오늘 목표는 연습 탭에 있어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything you've collected, whenever you want to browse it. Today's practice is on the Practice tab." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alles, was du gesammelt hast — zum Stöbern, wann immer du willst. Die heutige Übung steht im Übungs-Tab."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "지금까지 모은 것 전부 — 언제든 둘러보세요. 오늘 할 연습은 연습 탭에 있어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything you've practiced on this device — talks, drills, words, books — plus your languages, levels and goals, as one file. Use it to carry progress into another install. Your voice and minutes already follow your account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alles, was du auf diesem Gerät geübt hast — Gespräche, Drills, Wörter, Bücher — plus deine Sprachen, Level und Ziele, als eine Datei. Damit nimmst du deinen Fortschritt in eine andere Installation mit. Stimme und Minuten folgen ohnehin deinem Konto."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 기기에서 연습한 것 전부를 파일 하나로 묶어요. 대화, 드릴, 단어, 책에 언어·레벨·목표까지요. 다른 곳에 새로 깐 앱으로 진도를 옮길 때 쓰면 돼요. 목소리와 통화 시간은 원래 계정을 따라다녀요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
