    "In short: creating new audio in your voice costs credits. Practicing with what already exists doesn't." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kurz gesagt: Neues Audio in deiner Stimme kostet Credits. Mit Vorhandenem zu üben nicht."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "정리하면, 내 목소리로 새 오디오를 만들 때만 크레딧이 들어요. 이미 만들어진 걸로 연습하는 건 무료고요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In short: minutes buy speaking time with your fluent self. Practicing with what already exists is always free." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kurz gesagt: Minuten kaufen Sprechzeit mit deinem fließenden Ich. Mit dem zu üben, was schon da ist, ist immer kostenlos."
