    "Shadowing · words · replays · drills" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "섀도잉·단어학습·대화 재생·드릴 복습"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shadowing scores and review reps measure practice, not level. They live under Activity and in the Practice tab — doing them makes you better, and the level moves only when your speech does." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nachsprech-Punkte und Wiederholungen messen Übung, nicht Niveau. Sie stehen unter Activity und im Practice-Tab — sie machen dich besser, aber das Niveau bewegt sich erst, wenn sich dein Sprechen bewegt."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "섀도잉 점수와 복습 횟수는 레벨이 아니라 얼마나 연습했는지를 보여줘요. 활동과 복습 탭에 있고요. 연습하면 실력은 늘지만, 레벨은 실제로 말하는 게 달라져야 움직여요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shall we start small?" : {
      "comment" : "One of the first-run greetings, asking if they're ready to start small.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
