      }
    },
    "Talking needs a plan. Reviewing, replaying and building situations stay free either way." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of why reviewing, replaying and building situations stay free either way.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zum Sprechen brauchst du einen Tarif. Wiederholen, erneut Abspielen und Situationen erstellen bleiben so oder so kostenlos."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "대화하려면 요금제가 있어야 해요. 복습·다시 듣기·상황 만들기는 어느 쪽이든 무료고요."
          }
