    "Thank you" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "감사합니다"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks — this shapes launch pricing. Keep reviewing your saved words, drills, and dialogues anytime — that stays free." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Danke — das fließt in die Startpreise ein. Gesicherte Wörter, Übungen und Dialoge kannst du jederzeit weiter wiederholen — das bleibt kostenlos."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "고맙습니다. 출시 가격을 정하는 데 반영할게요. 저장한 단어·드릴·대화 복습은 언제든, 계속 무료예요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file held no practice data — nothing was restored. Export again from the other install and check the file is the one you just made." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Datei enthielt keine Übungsdaten – es wurde nichts wiederhergestellt. Exportiere noch einmal aus der anderen Installation und prüfe, ob es die gerade erstellte Datei ist."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "그 파일에는 연습 데이터가 없어서 아무것도 복원되지 않았어요. 다른 설치본에서 다시 내보낸 뒤, 방금 만든 파일이 맞는지 확인해 주세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That invite code isn't valid." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "없는 초대 코드예요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That means you really tested it — thank you. Before anything else: what should we fix first?" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dann hast du es wirklich auf die Probe gestellt — danke. Zuerst: Was sollten wir als Erstes beheben?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "그만큼 제대로 써 보셨다는 뜻이네요. 고맙습니다. 무엇부터 고치면 좋을까요?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's a lot of scenes this month" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이번 달 상황연습을 정말 많이 봤어요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's a lot of talking this month" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이번 달 정말 많이 이야기했어요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's enough — stop whenever you're ready" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이제 충분해요. 원할 때 멈추면 돼요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's this month's scenes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
