      }
    },
    "That's your session" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das war deine Sitzung"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오늘 세션 끝"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The avatar will play this role. You practice your side." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Avatar spielt diese Rolle. Du übst deine Seite."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "아바타가 이 역할을 연기해요. 나는 내 쪽을 연습해요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The better the mic, the better the voice that comes out. A wired mic is best if you have one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je besser das Mikrofon, desto besser die Stimme, die dabei herauskommt. Ein kabelgebundenes Mikrofon ist am besten, falls du eins hast."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "마이크가 좋을수록 완성된 목소리도 좋아져요. 유선 마이크가 있으면 그게 가장 좋고요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book couldn't be written to a file. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "책을 파일로 저장하지 못했어요. 다시 시도해 주세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The call clock is the meter — a 10-minute call uses 10 minutes. Thinking pauses cost the same as talking, just like a phone call." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "통화한 시간이 그대로 쓴 시간이에요. 10분 통화하면 10분. 전화가 그렇듯, 생각하느라 멈춘 시간도 똑같이 들어가요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Gespräch"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "대화"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation was saved, but the analysis that turns it into words, corrections and drill cards didn't finish. You can run it now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Gespräch wurde gespeichert, aber die Auswertung, die daraus Wörter, Korrekturen und Drill-Karten macht, wurde nicht fertig. Du kannst sie jetzt ausführen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "대화는 저장됐는데, 그걸 단어·교정·드릴 카드로 바꾸는 분석이 끝나지 못했어요. 지금 다시 돌릴 수 있어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation, its score, review cards and audio are removed for good. To keep it but leave it out of your stats, archive it instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gespräch, Bewertung, Wiederholungskarten und Audio werden endgültig entfernt. Wenn du es behalten, aber aus der Statistik nehmen willst, archiviere es stattdessen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "대화와 점수, 복습 카드, 오디오가 영구히 사라져요. 남겨 두되 통계에서만 빼려면 삭제 대신 보관하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Core" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Core"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "코어"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Core is full — all %lld seats taken." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Core ist voll — alle %lld Plätze belegt."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "코어가 다 찼어요. %lld자리 전부요."
