            "value" : "커리큘럼과 진행 상황도 함께 사라져요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The estimated level" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das geschätzte Niveau"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "추정 레벨"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first seats open on %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die ersten Plätze öffnen am %@."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "첫 자리는 %@에 열려요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fluent versions of your own sentences from this talk. Shadow one in your voice — score %lld+ and it's mastered." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die flüssigen Fassungen deiner eigenen Sätze aus diesem Gespräch. Sprich einen in deiner Stimme nach — ab %lld Punkten sitzt er."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 대화에서 내가 한 말을 더 자연스럽게 고친 문장들이에요. 내 목소리로 따라 말해서 %lld점을 넘기면 끝이에요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The iPhone's own mic." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "아이폰 마이크만 써요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The made voice" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "만들어진 목소리"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The message stays on your Talk tab either way — you can listen whenever." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Nachricht bleibt so oder so im Talk-Tab – du kannst sie jederzeit anhören."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "메시지는 어느 쪽이든 대화 탭에 남아요. 언제든 들으시면 돼요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The more you say it,\nthe more it's yours" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "말할수록,\n내 것이 된다"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The more you share, the more I'll sound like a version of you — not a textbook." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je mehr du erzählst, desto mehr klinge ich nach einer Version von dir — nicht nach einem Lehrbuch."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
