    "Watch has its own daily count, separate from your talk minutes. A scene costs one whichever way it runs — a long one and a short one cost the same." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "상황연습은 통화 시간을 쓰지 않아요. 대신 하루에 볼 수 있는 횟수가 따로 있어요. 하나 보면 그 수가 1 줄고, 길이는 상관없어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch has its own pool, separate from your talk minutes. A scene costs one whichever way it runs — a long one and a short one cost the same." : {
