    "Watch the scene, study its words and expressions, shadow your lines, then Talk it live." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sieh dir die Szene an, lerne ihre Wörter und Wendungen, sprich deine Sätze nach und führ es dann live als Gespräch."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "상황연습을 보고, 거기 나온 단어와 표현을 익히고, 내 대사를 섀도잉한 다음, 실제로 대화해 보세요."
