    },
    "Work meetings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "회사 회의"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wird bearbeitet…"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "처리 중…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "worried, on edge" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "긴장되고 불안한"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worth mentioning" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이런 걸 적으면 좋아요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write it in %@ — it's what \"you\" will talk from, and writing it is practice too. The specific beats the polished: your job, your town, the thing you'd actually talk about for an hour." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schreib sie auf %@ — daraus spricht „dein“ Persona, und das Schreiben selbst ist Übung. Konkret schlägt poliert: dein Job, dein Ort, das Thema, über das du wirklich eine Stunde reden würdest."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@로 써 보세요 — \"나\"가 이 소개를 바탕으로 말하고, 쓰는 것 자체가 연습이에요. 매끈한 문장보다 구체적인 내용이 좋아요: 하는 일, 사는 동네, 한 시간이고 떠들 수 있는 그 이야기."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write to us to see or correct what we hold about you, including the date you gave consent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schreib uns, um einzusehen oder zu korrigieren, was wir über dich gespeichert haben – einschließlich des Datums deiner Einwilligung."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "동의한 날짜를 비롯해 보관 중인 내 정보를 확인하거나 고치고 싶으면 문의해 주세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing down what you said…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schreibe auf, was du gesagt hast…"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "방금 말한 내용을 받아쓰는 중…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing the backup file. This is the slow part — keep the app open." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Backup-Datei wird geschrieben. Das ist der langsame Teil — lass die App offen."
