    },
    "You and your friend each get 300 credits when they join with your code — for up to 10 friends." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du und dein Freund bekommt je 300 Credits, wenn er mit deinem Code beitritt — für bis zu 10 Freunde."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "친구가 내 코드로 가입하면 둘 다 300 크레딧을 받아요. 최대 10명까지요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You and your friend each get about an hour of talk time when they join with your code — for up to 10 friends." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ihr bekommt beide rund eine Stunde Sprechzeit, wenn jemand mit deinem Code beitritt — für bis zu 10 Personen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "친구가 내 코드로 가입하면 둘 다 통화 시간을 약 1시간씩 받아요 — 최대 10명까지."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You asked to see these again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du wolltest sie wiedersehen"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "다시 보기로 한 항목이에요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't use your own code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "내 코드는 쓸 수 없어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You carried the whole story yourself and only stalled on tenses when it moved back in time. Next talk, try setting the scene in the past first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이야기를 처음부터 끝까지 혼자 끌고 갔어요. 지난 일로 넘어갈 때만 시제에서 멈칫했고요. 다음 대화에선 과거 배경부터 깔고 시작해 보세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You finished %lld card%@. They'll surface again on the Leitner schedule." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld Karte(n) geschafft. Sie tauchen nach dem Leitner-Plan wieder auf."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You finished %1$lld card%2$@. They'll surface again on the Leitner schedule."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "카드 %1$lld장을 끝냈어요. 복습 일정에 따라 다시 나타나요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You finished %lld cards. %lld more are waiting when you're ready." : {
      "comment" : "A message that appears when there are still drills left to review. The first argument is the initial count of drills. The second argument is the count of remaining drills.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast %1$lld Karten geschafft. %2$lld weitere warten, wenn du so weit bist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You finished %1$lld cards. %2$lld more are waiting when you're ready."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "카드 %1$lld장을 끝냈어요. 준비되면 %2$lld장이 더 기다리고 있어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You haven't used any talk time today." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast heute keine Sprechzeit verbraucht."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오늘은 통화 시간을 쓰지 않았어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You haven't used any talk time yet this month." : {
      "comment" : "Text shown in the \"This month\" section of the usage detail view when the user hasn't used any talk time yet this month.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이번 달에는 아직 통화 시간을 쓰지 않았어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You hit today's goal." : {
      "comment" : "Text displayed in a notification when a free talk goal is met.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast dein Tagesziel erreicht."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "오늘 목표 달성했어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You just heard yourself handle a real situation. Did it sound like you?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast dich gerade eine echte Situation meistern hören. Klang das nach dir?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "방금 내가 실제 상황을 풀어가는 걸 들으셨어요. 내 목소리 같던가요?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You just talked with your future voice. What felt right — and what felt off?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast gerade mit deiner zukünftigen Stimme gesprochen. Was hat gepasst — und was nicht?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "방금 유창해진 내 목소리와 대화하셨어요. 어떤 점이 좋았고, 어떤 점이 어색했나요?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need to be at least %lld to use this app. Making a voice model counts as biometric data, and the service that builds it does not allow it for younger users. Nothing has been saved." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du musst mindestens %lld Jahre alt sein, um diese App zu nutzen. Ein Stimmmodell zu erstellen gilt als Verarbeitung biometrischer Daten, und der Dienst dahinter erlaubt das für jüngere Nutzer nicht. Es wurde nichts gespeichert."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 앱은 만 %lld세 이상만 쓸 수 있습니다. 음성 모델은 생체인식정보라서, 모델을 만드는 서비스가 그보다 어린 이용자에게는 허용하지 않습니다. 입력하신 내용은 저장되지 않았습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need to be signed in." : {
      "comment" : "Error message shown when the user tries to submit feedback without being signed in.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "로그인이 필요해요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You reached for \"straightforward\" and \"follow-up\" unprompted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"straightforward\", \"follow-up\"을 먼저 꺼내 썼어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You said these" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "내가 쓴 말"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You skipped every line. They'll be waiting whenever you want to say them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast alle Sätze übersprungen. Sie warten, wann immer du sie sagen willst."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "모든 문장을 건너뛰었어요. 말하고 싶어질 때 그대로 기다리고 있을게요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You used it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "썼어요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You used this for the first time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Wort hast du zum ersten Mal benutzt."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이번에 처음 쓴 단어예요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You used what you practiced" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast Geübtes verwendet"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "연습한 걸 실제로 썼어요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You, but fluent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "유창해진 나"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll both get %lld minutes of talk time when you sign in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "로그인하면 둘 다 통화 시간 %lld분을 받아요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll both get 300 credits when you sign in." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ihr bekommt beide 300 Credits, sobald du dich anmeldest."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "로그인하면 둘 다 300 크레딧을 받아요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll read the script once more, about a minute. Recording again during setup is free, and this voice is replaced only if you keep the new one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du liest den Text noch einmal, etwa eine Minute. Eine erneute Aufnahme während des Setups ist kostenlos, und diese Stimme wird nur ersetzt, wenn du die neue behältst."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "대본을 한 번 더 읽으면 돼요. 1분쯤 걸려요. 설정 중에는 다시 녹음해도 무료고, 새 목소리를 선택할 때만 지금 목소리가 바뀌어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're about to build your fluent self — another you that already speaks fluent %@. This sets how it will speak and what it corrects. Not sure? Pick the closest — the app adjusts as you talk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gleich baust du dein fließendes Ich — ein anderes Du, das %@ bereits fließend spricht. Das hier legt fest, wie es spricht und was es korrigiert. Unsicher? Nimm das Nächstliegende — die App passt sich beim Sprechen an."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "여기서 고른 수준에 맞춰 대화 난이도와 고쳐주는 정도가 정해져요. 잘 모르겠으면 가장 가까운 걸 고르세요. 말하다 보면 알아서 맞춰가요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're already learning every language we support today. More are on the way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst bereits jede Sprache, die wir heute unterstützen. Weitere kommen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "지금 지원하는 언어를 이미 전부 배우고 계세요. 곧 더 늘려갈게요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're already subscribed." : {
      "comment" : "Error message when a user tries to redeem a code that's already been used.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이미 구독 중이에요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're at %.1f verified slips per 100 words%@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You're at %1$.1f verified slips per 100 words%2$@."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "100단어당 확인된 문법 실수가 %.1f개예요%@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're in" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "시작됐어요"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're in line, and there's room. You take a seat tonight." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "줄에 서 있고, 자리도 비어 있어요. 오늘 밤에 앉게 돼요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're in line. A seat opens when someone stops." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "줄에 서 있어요. 누군가 그만두면 자리가 나요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're in the beta — subscriptions aren't live yet. Your starting credits are final, but reviewing always stays free. Tell us what you'd want at launch on the next step." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist in der Beta — Abos sind noch nicht aktiv. Deine Start-Credits sind endgültig, aber Wiederholen bleibt immer kostenlos. Sag uns im nächsten Schritt, was du dir zum Start wünschst."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "아직 베타라 구독은 열리지 않았어요. 처음 받은 크레딧이 전부지만 복습은 언제나 무료예요. 출시 때 어떤 요금제를 원하시는지 다음 단계에서 알려주세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
