    },
    "Your level" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Niveau"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "내 레벨"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your level comes from periodic assessments — each one pools everything you've said since the previous assessment and judges it against the official CEFR speaking descriptors: range and precision of vocabulary, grammatical control across the errors you make, and how far you develop ideas. The first assessment unlocks after %lld minutes of talk; after that you're re-assessed each week you keep talking, and only assessments move your level." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Niveau ergibt sich aus regelmäßigen Einstufungen — jede bündelt alles, was du seit der letzten Einstufung gesagt hast, und misst es an den offiziellen GER-Deskriptoren fürs Sprechen: Umfang und Präzision des Wortschatzes, grammatische Kontrolle über deine Fehler hinweg und wie weit du Gedanken ausführst. Die erste Einstufung wird nach %lld Minuten Gespräch freigeschaltet; danach wirst du in jeder Woche, in der du weiter sprichst, neu eingestuft. Nur Einstufungen bewegen dein Niveau."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "레벨은 주기적인 평가로 정해져요. 평가할 때마다 직전 평가 이후에 말한 걸 전부 모아서, 공식 CEFR 말하기 기준에 비춰 봐요. 어휘를 얼마나 넓고 정확하게 쓰는지, 실수를 감안했을 때 문법을 얼마나 다루는지, 생각을 얼마나 끝까지 풀어내는지를 봅니다. 첫 평가는 대화 %lld분을 채우면 열리고, 그 뒤로는 대화를 이어가는 주마다 다시 평가해요. 레벨은 오직 평가로만 움직여요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your level is graded at your first assessment — one pooled judgment over ALL your talk, not a guess from one session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Niveau wird bei der ersten Einstufung vergeben — ein gebündeltes Urteil über ALLE deine Gespräche, keine Schätzung aus einer Sitzung."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "레벨은 첫 평가에서 매겨져요. 세션 하나로 짐작하는 게 아니라, 지금까지 말한 걸 전부 모아 한 번에 판정해요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your level is measured from the talks you actually have — it isn't a setting you keep in sync by hand." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Niveau wird aus deinen tatsächlichen Gesprächen gemessen — es ist keine Einstellung, die du von Hand pflegst."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "레벨은 실제로 나눈 대화에서 측정돼요. 손으로 맞춰 두는 설정이 아니고요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your level is re-assessed regularly. The next assessment needs both:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Niveau wird regelmäßig neu eingestuft. Die nächste Einstufung braucht beides:"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "레벨은 주기적으로 다시 평가해요. 다음 평가에는 두 가지가 모두 필요합니다:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your level is read from the words you actually used in a talk. No quiz, no self-rating." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "대화에서 실제로 쓴 단어로 레벨을 읽어요. 시험도, 자가 평가도 없어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your level, one point per assessment — this line is what growing looks like." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
